|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| On Primary | #FFFFFF | Foreground | #1E1B4B | Muted FG | #64748B |
| Secondary | #A78BFA | Card | #FFFFFF | Border | #DDD6FE |
| On Secondary | #0F172A | Card FG | #1E1B4B | Destructive | #DC2626 |
| Accent | #0891B2 | On Destructive | #FFFFFF | Ring | #7C3AED |
